OL,3,GNEWSAAmphibious car's nine-mile charity
OL,4,Ajourney
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn amphibious car is due to embark on a
OL,7,Fnine-mile journey from Guernsey to Sark
OL,8,Fto raise money for the St John Marine
OL,9,FAmbulance.
OL,11,FThe car has been transformed by marine
OL,12,Fambulance crew volunteers with the
OL,13,Fsupport of local businesses.
OL,15,FIt is due to leave from Old Lifeboat
OL,16,FSlipway, near the Model Yacht Pond on
OL,17,FGuernsey's Castle Emplacement, at about
OL,18,F09:30 BST.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
