OL,3,GNEWSAAmphibious car's nine-mile charity
OL,4,Ajourney
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Philips and Gary Ward will crew
OL,7,Fthe vessel - the same two volunteers
OL,8,Fwho completed a similar challenge in
OL,9,F1992.
